---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="媒体上传 | 曦清农业"
	description="将实验照片和视频上传到媒体存储，并生成可复制的实验记录字段。"
	noindex
>
	<main class="upload-page">
		<section class="page-hero shell">
			<div class="page-hero__heading">
				<h1>媒体上传</h1>
				<p>MEDIA INTAKE / R2</p>
			</div>
			<p class="page-hero__intro">上传后，文件进入实验媒体目录；接口会返回媒体 ID、访问地址和可粘贴到实验模板中的字段。未审核的内容不会显示在公开实验页。</p>
		</section>

		<section class="upload-section shell" aria-labelledby="upload-title">
			<div class="upload-layout">
				<div>
					<p class="eyebrow">MANUAL INTAKE</p>
					<h2 id="upload-title">先上传，再关联实验</h2>
					<p class="upload-copy">这一步适合现场照片、植物状态照片和短视频。设备或自动化程序以后可以复用同一个接口，不需要改媒体字段结构。</p>
					<div class="upload-rules">
						<p><strong>目录</strong><span>experiments/{'{experimentId}'}/{'{date}'}/{'{uuid}'}.{'{ext}'}</span></p>
						<p><strong>图片</strong><span>建议压缩到 10 MB 以内；视频先上传关键短片。</span></p>
						<p><strong>审核</strong><span>公开展示前请将审核状态设为“已确认”。</span></p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<form id="media-upload-form" class="upload-form" enctype="multipart/form-data">
					<div class="form-field">
						<label for="experiment-id">实验编号 <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
						<input id="experiment-id" name="experimentId" required pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}" placeholder="T01-001" autocomplete="off" />
					</div>
					<div class="form-row">
						<div class="form-field">
							<label for="media-kind">媒体类型</label>
							<select id="media-kind" name="kind">
								<option value="image">图片</option>
								<option value="video">视频</option>
							</select>
						</div>
						<div class="form-field">
							<label for="captured-at">拍摄时间 <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
							<input id="captured-at" name="capturedAt" type="datetime-local" required />
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="form-field">
						<label for="media-file">选择图片或视频 <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
						<input id="media-file" name="file" type="file" accept="image/*,video/*" required />
						<small>上传接口会校验文件类型和大小，不会把文件写入 GitHub。</small>
					</div>
					<div id="media-preview" class="upload-preview" hidden aria-live="polite"></div>
					<div class="form-field">
						<label for="caption">媒体说明 <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
						<input id="caption" name="caption" required placeholder="第 7 天根系状态" />
					</div>
					<div class="form-field">
						<label for="media-alt">无障碍描述 <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
						<textarea id="media-alt" name="alt" rows="2" required placeholder="一株生菜根系的现场照片"></textarea>
					</div>
					<div class="form-row">
						<div class="form-field">
							<label for="event-id">关联事件</label>
							<input id="event-id" name="eventId" placeholder="EVT-T01-001-001" />
						</div>
						<div class="form-field">
							<label for="plant-id">关联植物</label>
							<input id="plant-id" name="plantId" placeholder="PLANT-001" />
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="form-row">
						<div class="form-field">
							<label for="visibility">可见范围</label>
							<select id="visibility" name="visibility">
								<option value="public">公开实验页</option>
								<option value="private">仅内部</option>
							</select>
						</div>
						<div class="form-field">
							<label for="review-status">审核状态</label>
							<select id="review-status" name="reviewStatus">
								<option value="pending">待审核</option>
								<option value="confirmed">已确认</option>
							</select>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="form-field">
						<label for="upload-token">上传口令</label>
						<input id="upload-token" name="uploadToken" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="由管理员配置的 MEDIA_UPLOAD_TOKEN" />
						<small>口令只用于本次请求，不会写入实验记录。</small>
					</div>
					<button class="button button--dark upload-submit" type="submit"><span>上传并生成记录字段</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
					<p id="upload-status" class="upload-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
				</form>
			</div>
			<div id="upload-result" class="upload-result" hidden aria-live="polite">
				<div class="record-section__heading"><p class="eyebrow">RETURNED RECORD</p><h2>可复制字段</h2></div>
				<p id="upload-result-note"></p>
				<pre id="upload-snippet"><code></code></pre>
				<button id="copy-snippet" class="button" type="button">复制到剪贴板 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>

<script src="../scripts/media-upload.ts"></script>
